OL,3,GNEWSABlack sunflower art to raise
OL,4,Aawareness for Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn artist who has been painting
OL,7,Fsunflowers black says he hopes the work
OL,8,Fwill help raise awareness about the war
OL,9,Fin Ukraine.
OL,11,FAbout 100 sunflowers were planted by
OL,12,Fartist Duncan McKellar on a plot of
OL,13,Flawn next to Bristol's City Hall.
OL,15,FMcKellar planted the flowers as a
OL,16,F"guerilla artwork memorial" last year
OL,17,Fbut has since been given permission and
OL,18,Fis painting the plants black as they
OL,19,Fnaturally die as a way of further
OL,20,Fraising awareness of the conflict.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
