OL,3,GNEWSABlack sunflower art to raise
OL,4,Aawareness for Ukraine
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Black itself is synonymous with death,
OL,7,Fthe flowers themselves have died and
OL,8,Fthey're arranged in a grid which is
OL,9,Fintended to look like war graves," said
OL,10,FMcKellar of his artwork entitled
OL,11,FFlowers for the Fallen.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
